{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12698","headline":"刘侍御月夜讌会 · 元结","name":"刘侍御月夜讌会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我从苍梧来，将耕旧山田。\n踟蹰爲故人，且复停归船。\n日夕得相从，转觉和乐全。\n愚爱凉风来，明月正满天。\n河汉望不见，几星犹粲然。\n中夜兴欲酣，改坐临清川。\n未醉恐天旦，更歌促繁弦。\n欢娱不可逢，请君莫言旋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}